    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You owe the Soul Taker a huge debt for giving you another chance to live but the consequences of your deal is to <strong>repay them by slaying others and earning gold.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the Black Siege</strong>, a place where slaying fellow humans and money hoarding is legal. In this place, every humans you slay will be resurrected and will be yours for you to command.\u00a0<br>This is the perfect place to earn and build your economy to repay the Soul Taker.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SLAY, EARN, SAVE GOLD, PAY DEBT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820010/extras/32b6e7f1bec43e1ed62c099868ff810b.poster.avif?t=1728921763\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820010/extras/32b6e7f1bec43e1ed62c099868ff810b.webm?t=1728921763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820010/extras/32b6e7f1bec43e1ed62c099868ff810b.mp4?t=1728921763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUY ENEMIES, SLAY THEM, RESURRECT THEM, EARN FROM THEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820010/extras/f20047b9d51e5e4bb54773e50cd39f47.poster.avif?t=1728921763\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820010/extras/f20047b9d51e5e4bb54773e50cd39f47.webm?t=1728921763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820010/extras/f20047b9d51e5e4bb54773e50cd39f47.mp4?t=1728921763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to strategize on how you will save and build your economy because the Soul Taker means business and <strong>if you fail to pay your debt even once, then it's your life on the line.<br>Good luck newly resurrected human person - have fun in the Black Siege.</strong></p>",
